{
  "bodyHash": "5e53587be9ba21b4",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qgN1Bgf.png\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mbSQxHhbBt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ENSE1Om.png\" width=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYoCsJCHn1jOnGvKLBs0bqg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LTDGG4f.png\" width=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ProjectCount\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MSv7RBC.png\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">该插件是为 Alex's Caves 模组创建的，它为五种类型的洞穴中的每一种都添加了新内容。该模组不会创建新的洞穴，而是改进现有的洞穴。通过此模组，洞穴将变得更加多样化、有趣，并为 Alex's Caves 世界中的创造力提供新的机会。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><em>“视觉与阴影更新”</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WtNgGxl.png\"></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><em>下次更新 --&gt;</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/F51rbVx.png\"></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files/5188427\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/APp8aOz.png\" width=\"300\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves/files/5162617\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/r4YN738.png\" width=\"300\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create/files/4835191\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rp5RLvq.png\" width=\"300\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight/files/5051242\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZHLmSnS.png\" width=\"300\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">📨新增/修改📃</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">☢剧毒洞穴☢</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">H型炸弹</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rWZoMdt.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">现在，您可以制造一种核弹，其威力是标准核弹的 11.5 倍，称为聚变炸弹。它只能用红石方块激活，建议从远处引爆，因为其爆炸是瞬间发生的。爆炸后，半径 70+ 格内的所有生物都将不复存在，巨大的蓝色核蘑菇云将升上天空。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- 要制造这种炸弹，您需要两种新材料：改进的黑石和钚（钚是在核熔炉中通过烧炼铀制成的）。</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/II6egom.png\" width=\"695\" height=\"391\">&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TudcyPZ.png\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WF9BApV.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">微型炸弹</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/umesKUR.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>🧲磁性洞穴🧲</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">紫色磁铁</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QGklQFp.png\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>- 蝙蝠。</strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">将纯黑暗方块放置在紫色磁铁上，然后点击磁铁以获取能量。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>- 食物。</strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">将灯塔放置在紫色磁铁上并按压磁铁，您将受到灯塔能量的补给。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- <span style=\"font-size:18px\">辐射。</span>&nbsp;将聚变炸弹放置在紫色磁铁上并点击它，半径 50 格内的所有人都会受到辐射。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- <span style=\"font-size:18px\">时间。</span>&nbsp;将催化剂放置在紫色磁铁上并按压它，您将成为时间本身。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- <span style=\"font-size:18px\">传送。</span>&nbsp;将龙蛋放置在紫色磁铁上，并使用迷你紫色磁铁点击它以设置检查点。使用迷你磁铁可以从任何地方进行传送。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">磁性村民</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Uns3FUF.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kETYdtC.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RzWE0JJ.png\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">新的地牢现在将在磁性洞穴中生成，您可以在其中找到三种居民之一。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;所有商人都是用紫色磁屑出售商品。右键点击持有磁屑的商人，他就会向您抛出他的商品。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">磁性守卫</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3bPVrWU.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">大型球形封印现在将在磁性洞穴中生成。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">磁铁物品</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PCuoDWA.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2R8k03P.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 在空磁铁上点击紫色磁锭，将出现具有 5 个独特功能的紫色磁铁。此外，这些功能也被三叉戟复制。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 红色和蓝色磁铁与 Farmer's Delight 模组集成，添加了很酷的食物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 紫色磁铁是一种所谓的引导石，它将您传送到设置在紫色磁铁上的点。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">虚空炸弹</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EvscOIt.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">一种在 10 秒内吸收约 20,000+ 格的炸弹。创造出所谓的黑洞。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 通过将聚变炸弹放置在紫色磁铁上并用下界之星点击聚变炸弹来制造它。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mngd7El.png\" width=\"695\" height=\"391\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">将龙蛋放置在虚空炸弹上，并用红石方块激活它，以唤醒巨龙。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>🦎原始洞穴🦖<br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jn9Luwy.png\" width=\"695\" height=\"391\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">使用第二阶段的蛋，将其放置在古老琥珀块下方，并从上方点燃它。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <span style=\"font-size:14px\">您可以使用古老琥珀碎片制作古老琥珀块，也可以从已经掉落的琥珀堆中获得它。或者您可以使用两块普通琥珀合成它。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/80WhIEU.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">在集成 Create 模组的情况下，您可以制作改进的下界合金盔甲，但除了提供更好的保护外，它还会使您成为一台活体钻头，所以无论您去哪里，都不会有任何东西阻挡您的去路。小心不要穿着它回到基地。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>🐟深渊裂谷🌊</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MFW5MyE.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/juk8pDN.png\" width=\"695\" height=\"391\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">血珠可以在渔夫处以最高等级购买。价格为 32 个绿宝石。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:14px\">要在第二阶段唤醒巨龙，请在深渊裂谷生物群系的水面上方放置一个由金块组成的 3x3 平台。将上一阶段的裂纹蛋放在中心。然后用血珠点击鸡蛋。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0HGHrxv.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">在集成 Farmer's Delight 模组的情况下：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 生物发光三明治 - 含有生物发光的三明治，营养价值 10，饱和度 0.5。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">&nbsp;- 融解磁铁 - 由两个迷你磁铁制成。营养价值 20，饱和度 5。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">&nbsp;- 琥珀美味 - 要获得这些糖果，您可以劈开一块古老琥珀。营养价值 15，饱和度 0.7。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>👽<strong>孤寂空洞</strong>👽</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Sgc37Ku.png\" width=\"695\" height=\"391\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">两块纯黑暗可以用来制作一根法杖。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">右键点击它，击中第三阶段的蛋，然后享受吧。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">🎥视频🎥</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/91tMisxYRZ8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">👀查看</span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/91tMisxYRZ8\" height=\"314\" width=\"560\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🎨 我们的模组</span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vegetables-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sTYFDIt.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-changes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0EvRMeF.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/piglin-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msiJ1Qo.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-randomite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5W1ePQ5.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/genetics-vegetables\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MrznpWc.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/schizophrenia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N3mWm8R.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VI5tY37.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-creative-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aPIDl78.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bamboo-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KfWDC6t.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hardness-diamond-ore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/40qWlek.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sweet-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ycApO0w.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/usa-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6KmYwH9.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/italy-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XSzP3Eu.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xIUPfrh.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.co